@* The visual editor's frame requires a signed-in admin user. Applied here rather than the root _Imports so it
   does not land on App.razor or Routes.razor, which must render for signed-out users. The toolbar is rendered
   on the site by VisualEditorScriptGenerator, not routed, so it isn't affected. *@
@attribute [AdminBlazorAuthorize]
@layout VisualEditorFrameLayout
